    "wikipedia_summary": "<i><b>Lepidium graminifolium</b></i>, the <b>grassleaf pepperweed</b> or <b>tall pepperwort</b>, is a species of annual herb in the family Brassicaceae. They have a self-supporting growth form and simple, broad leaves. Flowers are visited by <i>Ruiziella luctuosa</i>. Individuals can grow to 51 cm tall.",
